A '''species''' of beings was found throughout [[the galaxy]] that included among its members [[Armo Malou]], a [[bartender]] who worked at the [[Canto Casino and Racetrack]] on [[Cantonica]].<ref name="TLJ Sticker">''[[Star Wars: The Last Jedi: Ultimate Sticker Collection]]''</ref> Another [[Unidentified store clerk|member]] worked as a [[Anchorhead General Store|supply store]] clerk on [[Tatooine]] during the [[Imperial Era]]. Both individuals sported metal bolts protruding from their [[Nose|snouts]].<ref name="Kenobi Part VI" />

